IMPORT `il36-nouns`

-- The Encouragement of Aliyah and Return (Temporary Provision) Law, 5786-2026, s 1: definitions.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of the deposited transcription.
--
-- WHAT THIS SECTION DOES.  It defines the Law's own terms.  Those it takes from the Income Tax
-- Ordinance (material shareholder, other income, relative, transparent corporation, veteran
-- returning resident, resident, non-resident) are inputs, one field each (il36-nouns.l4), narrowed
-- where this section narrows them.
--
-- NOT ENCODED, being inert for a computation: "הפקודה" (the Ordinance itself), "תושב חוץ" and
-- "תושב ישראל" (the Ordinance's own definitions, inputs).

§ `Section 1 — definitions`

§§ `A refusal that marks a bug in this model`

-- A rule that needs a concrete reading of a fork was handed the declined one.  The public rules in
-- il36-answers.l4 resolve every fork a question depends on before they call a rule that needs a
-- concrete reading, so this refusal is reached only by calling such a rule directly.
@ref il36-answers.l4, `the number answered at every reading the switches leave open`
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`a rule that needs a concrete reading was handed a reading the text does not decide; resolve the readings first (il36-answers.l4)` MEANS
    REFUSE "a rule that needs a concrete reading was handed a reading the text does not decide; resolve the readings first (il36-answers.l4)"

§§ `"עולה" (immigrant)`

-- src:11 | ״עולה״ – יחיד שבידו אשרת עולה או תעודת עולה לפי חוק השבות, התש״י–1950, או מי שנמנה עם סוג בני אדם שנקבע לגביהם שזכאים לסל קליטה לפי סעיף 2 לחוק סל קליטה, התשנ״ה–1994, אך למעט מי שאזרחותו הישראלית בוטלה על פי סעיף 11 לחוק האזרחות, התשי״ב–1952;
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 1 "עולה" (transcription line 11)
GIVEN `the person` IS AN `An individual`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 — an immigrant` `the person` MEANS
        (   `the person`'s `holds an oleh visa or an oleh certificate under the Law of Return`
         OR `the person`'s `is counted in a class of persons determined entitled to an absorption basket under section 2 of the Absorption Basket Law`)
    AND NOT `the person`'s `had Israeli citizenship cancelled under section 11 of the Citizenship Law`

§§ `"תושב חוזר ותיק" (veteran returning resident)`

-- src:15 | ״תושב חוזר ותיק״ – כהגדרתו בסעיף 14(א) לפקודה, ובלבד שבידו תעודת תושב חוזר שהנפיק לו משרד העלייה והקליטה;
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 1 "תושב חוזר ותיק" (transcription line 15)
GIVEN `the person` IS AN `An individual`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 — a veteran returning resident` `the person` MEANS
        `the person`'s `is a veteran returning resident as section 14(a) of the Ordinance defines the term`
    AND `the person`'s `holds a returning resident certificate issued by the Ministry of Aliyah and Integration`

§§ `"קרוב" (relative)`

-- src:13 | ״קרוב״ – כהגדרתו בסעיף 88 לפקודה, למעט חברה שבבעלותו המלאה של העולה;
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 1 "קרוב" (transcription line 13)
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `An item of income`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 — an item received from a relative` `the item` MEANS
        `the item`'s `received from a relative as section 88 of the Ordinance defines the term`
    AND NOT `the item`'s `received from a company wholly owned by the immigrant`

§§ `"הכנסה מזכה" (qualifying income), by its kind`

-- "הכנסה חייבת שהיא הכנסה מיגיעה אישית לפי סעיף 2(1) או (2) לפקודה": chargeable income that is income
-- from personal exertion under s 2(1) or (2) of the Ordinance;
-- "שאינה הכנסה אחרת": that is not "other income";
-- "ואינה הכנסה המיוחסת לעולה או לתושב חוזר ותיק מתאגיד שקוף": and is not income attributed to the
-- immigrant or veteran returning resident from a transparent corporation;
-- "למעט הכנסה מתאגיד שקוף המיוחסת" to the immigrant or veteran returning resident "לפי סעיף 62א לפקודה": except income from a transparent
-- corporation attributed under s 62A of the Ordinance.
--
-- Where the exception attaches is fork F2.  Read, as its position after the second exclusion
-- suggests, as an exception to that exclusion (reading A), income attributed under s 62A IS
-- qualifying although a transparent corporation paid it.  Read as a further exclusion (reading B) it
-- adds nothing to the second exclusion, which already removes such income: B is the reading that
-- leaves the exception without effect.  The text does not decide; the default declines (by name,
-- il36-answers.l4) a case where the item is attributed from a transparent corporation under s 62A.
--
-- WHAT THIS RULE DOES NOT COVER (it covers a kind of income; the facts of a particular item are in
-- il36-s2-exemption.l4): that the income was produced or accrued in Israel, while the person was a
-- resident, in a listed tax year, and is not income the person asked not to have exempted.
-- src:10 | ״הכנסה מזכה״ – הכנסה חייבת שהיא הכנסה מיגיעה אישית לפי סעיף 2(1) או (2) לפקודה, שאינה הכנסה אחרת ואינה הכנסה המיוחסת לעולה או לתושב חוזר ותיק מתאגיד שקוף, למעט הכנסה מתאגיד שקוף המיוחסת לעולה או לתושב חוזר ותיק לפי סעיף 62א לפקודה;
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 1 "הכנסה מזכה" (transcription line 10); fork F2
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `An item of income`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 — an item of a source the Law reaches` `the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the item`'s `the source`
    WHEN `a business or profession, section 2(1) of the Ordinance` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `work, section 2(2) of the Ordinance`                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `any other source of income`                              THEN FALSE

@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 1 "הכנסה מזכה", the exception (transcription line 10); fork F2
GIVEN `the reading` IS A `A reading of the exception for income attributed under section 62A`
      `the item`    IS AN `An item of income`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 — the exception for income attributed under section 62A applies to the item, reading it as` `the reading` `:` `the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the reading`
    WHEN `income attributed under section 62A is qualifying income although it comes from a transparent corporation`
    THEN `the item`'s `attributed to the individual under section 62A of the Ordinance`
    WHEN `income attributed under section 62A is not qualifying income because it comes from a transparent corporation`
    THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a case that turns on the exception for income attributed under section 62A is declined`
    THEN `a rule that needs a concrete reading was handed a reading the text does not decide; resolve the readings first (il36-answers.l4)`

@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 1 "הכנסה מזכה" (transcription line 10); fork F2
GIVEN `the reading` IS A `A reading of the exception for income attributed under section 62A`
      `the item`    IS AN `An item of income`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 — qualifying income by its kind, reading the exception for section 62A as` `the reading` `:` `the item` MEANS
        `the item`'s `chargeable income apart from this Law's own exemption`
    AND `the item`'s `income from personal exertion as the Ordinance defines it`
    AND `s 1 — an item of a source the Law reaches` `the item`
    AND NOT `the item`'s `other income as section 62A(d) of the Ordinance defines it`
    AND NOT (    `the item`'s `attributed to the individual from a transparent corporation`
             AND NOT `s 1 — the exception for income attributed under section 62A applies to the item, reading it as` `the reading` `:` `the item`)
